1. WHAT THIS WEBSITE IS\
----------------------------------------------------------------\
A set of 7 independent HTML files. Each is a complete, standalone\
web page \'97 no frameworks, no build step, no server-side code.\
You can open any of them by double-clicking, and they work as-is.\
The whole site is plain text + images. It belongs entirely to you\
and does not depend on any chat, account, or external service.\
