7. GETTING HELP LATER (e.g. from a fresh AI chat)\
----------------------------------------------------------------\
You do NOT need to remember any past conversation. In a new chat:\
  1. Upload the specific HTML file you want changed.\
  2. Describe the change in plain words.\
  3. Get the edited file back.\
The file itself contains all the structure needed to understand it.\
You can also upload this README for extra context.\
